+# Windows Streaming Agent API Contracts
+
+## 1. Authentication
+The agent authenticates via custom HTTP header or Bearer JWT token:
+- `X-NexusAgent-API-Key: <secret_key>`
+- `Authorization: Bearer <agent_jwt>`
+
+## 2. API Endpoints
+
+### GET /api/v1/agent/session/{sessionId}/config
+Retrieves configuration parameters for initializing a streaming session.
+
+**Response:** `200 OK`
+```json
+{
+  "sessionId": "sess_12345",
+  "userId": "user_67890",
+  "videoSettings": {
+    "targetResolution": "1920x1080",
+    "targetFps": 60,
+    "maxBitrateKbps": 15000,
+    "codec": "H264",
+    "enableHardwareAcceleration": true
+  },
+  "inputSettings": {
+    "mouseMode": "Relative",
+    "enableGamepad": true
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### POST /api/v1/agent/status
+Reports agent readiness, system load, and performance telemetry.
+
+**Payload:**
+```json
+{
+  "agentId": "agent-win-01",
+  "sessionId": "sess_12345",
+  "cpuUsagePercent": 18.5,
+  "gpuUsagePercent": 42.0,
+  "memoryUsageMb": 3072,
+  "currentFps": 60.0
+}
+```
+
+### POST /api/v1/agent/terminate
+Reports active stream shutdown.
+
+**Payload:**
+```json
+{
+  "sessionId": "sess_12345",
+  "agentId": "agent-win-01",
+  "reason": "UserDisconnected"
+}
+```
+
+## 3. SignalR Real-Time Telemetry Hub
+Endpoint: `/hubs/agent`
+- Methods:
+  - `ReportMetrics(AgentStatusReportDto metrics)`
+  - `NotifyTermination(string sessionId, string reason)`
